  "what": "A broad sample of calc() geocentric apparent positions (true ecliptic of date) and of the Sun's and the Moon's event times against JPL DE421, beside the published measured bounds, which are the largest differences seen on the 32-instant Horizons corpus (docs/evidence/calc-api/rc16).",
